# Licensed fonts, and anything that points at them.
#
# The fidelity harness compares our render against PowerPoint's, and that comparison is
# only meaningful when both sides draw with the *same* faces -- the real Calibri, Cambria
# and Aptos that Office installs.  Those are licensed to Office and must never be copied
# into this repository, so the harness reads them in place through a local profile that
# names paths on the machine that wrote it.  The profile is per-machine by construction
# and the fonts are not ours to redistribute; neither is committable.
/tests/font-profile.local.json
/tests/local-fonts/
/oracle-fonts/
*.ttf.local
